@startuml
actor "Association Staff" as Staff
participant "Nexo" as System
Staff -> System: Register resource (name, type, description)
activate System
System -> System: Validate details and check permission to manage resources
alt Valid and authorized
    System --> Staff: Resource created with status "Available"
else Invalid details or unauthorized
    System --> Staff: Registration rejected (validation or authorization error)
end
deactivate System
@enduml
